(text "RMX A0.2 / COMPUTE / DRAFT - U1 uses PHYSICAL header numbers. D numbers are carried in pin names, not pad numbers." (at 15 13 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 1c7eecff-f255-572d-8cfd-6c707c80114d))
(text "Use the 64MB SDRAM Rev7 Seed. VIN = 5V. Pin 38 supplies 3.3V; never parallel another 3.3V regulator into this output." (at 15 17 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid e762ffbb-64d1-550c-b2b2-731e9442925a))
(text "MPR121 breakout terminals are LABELS, not IC pin numbers. Vin = 3.3V. Check module revision, pull-ups and electrode/lens geometry." (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 1d391c1a-2b6e-5114-8fd3-cbfda13a3dcb))
(text "Service USB VBUS must be blocked at both cable ends. Direct USB power bypasses the power switch. D29/D30 remain unused." (at 15 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 28571ec4-dd0b-5cb3-8339-7adf03aec32c))
